# AstraRealism - English (US)
#
# Keys:
#   screen.X    title of a settings sub-screen
#   profile.X   name of a quality preset
#   option.X    label for an option
#   comment.X   tooltip shown on hover
#   value.X.v   label for a specific enum value
#   suffix.X    unit appended to the displayed value
# ==============================================================================

